"releaseNotes":"- New quiz mode to test your Circle of Fifths knowledge\n- Settings: choose between English (A, B) and German (A, H) notation\n- Settings: toggle auto-play audio on selection\n- German mnemonics for German-speaking users\n- Scale degrees now show correct enharmonic spellings\n- Improved chord shape view with helpful tips\n\nNow available in 24 languages: Arabic, Chinese (Simplified & Traditional), Danish, Dutch, English, French, German, Hindi, Indonesian, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Latvian, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese (Brazil & Portugal), Russian, Spanish, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, and Vietnamese.", "genres":["Music", "Education"], "price":0.00, "artistId":1317949625, "artistName":"Sincere Apps", "trackName":"Circle of Fifths Guide", "trackId":6683300008, "bundleId":"kirsteins.com.CircleOfFifths", "sellerName":"Sincere Apps SIA", "primaryGenreName":"Music", "primaryGenreId":6011, "genreIds":["6011", "6017"], "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-02-12T14:42:33Z", "version":"2.0", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"MAKE AND REMEMBER THE CIRCLE OF FIFTHS EASILY\n\nUnlock the full potential of your musical journey with our interactive “Make and Remember the Circle of Fifths” feature. Master the Circle of Fifths effortlessly using engaging mnemonics and visual aids that make memorization fun.\n\nProgress through 11 intuitive steps at your own pace. Use the Next and Previous buttons to navigate, and reset anytime to reinforce your learning. Memorize sharp keys with the phrase: “Caroline Gets Drunk And Eats Butterflies” and remember flat keys with: “Caroline Finds BEADs”.\n\nWhether you're a beginner or an experienced musician, this feature simplifies the Circle of Fifths, making it accessible and enjoyable for everyone. Start mastering the Circle of Fifths today and elevate your understanding of music theory.\n\nKEY SIGNATURES MADE SIMPLE\n\nDiscover key signatures effortlessly with our interactive Circle of Fifths tool. Select any key from the dynamic Circle of Fifths diagram to instantly view its major and minor scales, including enharmonic equivalents. See at a glance the number of sharps or flats and the specific notes involved.\n\nThe intuitive design highlights your chosen key, providing both visual and textual information to deepen your understanding of music theory. Perfect for musicians at any level, this feature makes learning key signatures engaging and straightforward.\n\nEnhance your music theory knowledge by exploring the Circle of Fifths in a whole new way. Dive into key signatures and unlock the secrets of harmony with ease.\n\nCHORDS IN KEY SIMPLIFIED\n\nEffortlessly explore all the chords within any key using our interactive “Chords in Key” feature, seamlessly integrated with the Circle of Fifths. Select a key to instantly view its related major and minor chords displayed in an intuitive layout.\n\nTap on any chord to hear it played, connecting visual patterns with actual sounds. The interactive Circle of Fifths adapts to your selection, making it easy to understand chord relationships and progressions. Perfect for musicians and songwriters looking to deepen their harmonic knowledge and enhance their musical creativity.\n\nExperience the Circle of Fifths like never before, and simplify your understanding of chords in any key.\n\nVISUALIZE CHORD SHAPES INSTANTLY\n\nUnlock a deeper understanding of chords with our interactive “Chord Shapes” feature, powered by the Circle of Fifths. Select any root note and chord type to see its shape displayed on the Circle of Fifths.\n\nThe app highlights chord tones on both the Circle of Fifths and a virtual piano keyboard, bridging the gap between music theory and practical application. Listen to each chord with the built-in playback feature, connecting visual patterns with actual sounds.\n\nPerfect for musicians at any level, this feature makes exploring chord shapes engaging and straightforward. Unlock advanced chords by upgrading to the full version and support further app development by an indie developer.\n\nDive into the Circle of Fifths and visualize chord shapes like never before.\n\nEmbark on a musical journey with the Circle of Fifths as your guide. Download the app now and transform the way you learn and play music!", "languageCodesISO2A":["AR", "DA", "NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "HI", "ID", "IT", "JA", "KO", "LV", "NB", "PL", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "ES", "SV", "TH", "ZH", "TR", "VI"], "fileSizeBytes":"22455296", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":136, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.78676000000000012590817277668975293636322021484375, "minimumOsVersion":"17.0", "releaseDate":"2024-09-18T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":136}, 
