"description":"The Circle of Atonement Community App is a space for spiritual seekers who want to go deeper with A Course in Miracles (Complete and Annotated Edition) and engage with its teachings in a supportive, like-minded community. Whether you are new to the Course or have studied for years, this app offers a dedicated space for study, connection, and transformation—all in one place, saving you time and effort on your learning journey.\n\nInside the app, you’ll find daily Course inspiration, exclusive content from ACIM experts, study groups and discussions that help you explore teachings in depth, a supportive and judgment-free community where you can ask questions and share breakthroughs, and live events and workshops to engage with fellow seekers. \n\nTo get started, simply select a plan and you’ll not only make consistent progress in your understanding of ACIM, but you’ll also experience the life-changing gifts A Course in Miracles offers. Imagine having a deep and unshakable inner peace, no matter what challenges arise. Imagine releasing grievances through true forgiveness, freeing your mind from the burdens of resentment. And imagine relationships transformed from conflict into holy partnerships filled with love and understanding. \n\nWe’ve been a trusted resource for those who want to learn A Course in Miracles for more than 30 years. To take your ACIM journey to the next level in a community of safe and inclusive spiritual companions, download the Circle of Atonement Community App today. Your first week is on us and, if you decide to cancel before the one-week trial period ends, you won’t be charged a thing.\n\n-----\nTerms of Use: mightynetworks.com/terms-of-use", "languageCodesISO2A":["NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "PT", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes":"140221440", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":76, "trackContentRating":"9+", "sellerUrl":"https://circleofa.org/", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.82894999999999985362819643341936