"description":"Master music theory with an interactive Circle of Fifths wheel, chord charts, scale diagrams, and a precision metronome - all in one app.\n\nINTERACTIVE CIRCLE OF FIFTHS\nSwipe the wheel to explore all 12 keys. Tap any note to hear it. Instantly see the relationship between major and minor keys, sharps, and flats.\n\nSCALES & MODES\nVisual fretboard and keyboard diagrams for:\n- Major, Natural Minor, Harmonic Minor\n- Pentatonic (Major & Minor), Blues\n- All 7 modes: Dorian, Phrygian, Lydian, Mixolydian, Aeolian, Locrian\n\nCHORD LIBRARY\nPiano chord charts for Major, Minor, Dominant 7th, Major 7th, and Minor 7th - generated instantly for any key.\n\nMETRONOME\nKeep perfect time while you practice scales and chords.\n\nINSTRUMENTS\nGuitar, Bass Guitar, and Piano - with color-coded diagrams for easy learning.\n\nPerfect for guitar players, pianists, music students, songwriters, and anyone learning music theory. No internet required.\n\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"51479552", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":289, "trackContentRating":"4+", "sellerUrl":"https://olricdigital.com/", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.51902999999999988034460329799912869930267333984375, "minimumOsVersion":"18.6", "releaseDate":"2020-05-13T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":289}]
